## This repository contains no binaries

This plugin ships **source code, a manifest, and documentation only**. It does
not contain, bundle, mirror, or re-package the `miloco-mcp-server` executable or
any part of it — not in the repository, not in the published npm package, and
not in any release artifact.

At run time the plugin downloads a platform-specific build from channels
operated by the rights holder, verifies its checksum against
`manifest/server-manifest.json`, and installs it into the user's own machine
(`~/.dsh/dsh-feyagate/`). The downloaded binary is **not** distributed by this
project, and nothing in this repository grants any right to it.

